hi Karl
I have done a physical map with Mbp in R/qtl, Does the program calculate the genetic map (cM distance between all markers), for instance, I am using maize double haploid biparental population. I have a physical location of SNPs in Mbp. can you please let me know how to calculate intermarker distance in cM

Thanks a lot

